    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add Wishlist</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into RC Revolution High Voltage, the exhilarating free version of RC Revolution </h2>Select from three dynamic cars, unlock a fourth, and challenge our AI for a fifth. Customize for style and performance, and get ready for stunt-filled tracks and nitro-fueled speed craze. Your high-nitro adventure awaits!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/0163d2576742aa9669db1b345933beb3.poster.avif?t=1707397779\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/0163d2576742aa9669db1b345933beb3.webm?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/0163d2576742aa9669db1b345933beb3.mp4?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the Thrill of RC Revolution High Voltage</h2>Discover RC Revolution High Voltage \u2013 the ultimate free RC racing adventure! Choose your car, master stunts, and unleash nitro speeds. This game blends strategy with exhilarating action, offering a unique, timeless racing experience. Dive into a world of speed, skill, and style!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/06fd37bc72afe20c8ef90632efd34260.poster.avif?t=1707397779\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/06fd37bc72afe20c8ef90632efd34260.webm?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/06fd37bc72afe20c8ef90632efd34260.mp4?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exhilarating Stunts and Individual Triumphs</h2>Master extreme jumps, twists, and flips in this solo racing adventure. Customize for peak performance, conquer challenging tracks, and elevate your racing prowess. Every race is a chance to defy gravity and make your mark!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/e15f2876cd30ddc8cd193c80cc7694f3.poster.avif?t=1707397779\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/e15f2876cd30ddc8cd193c80cc7694f3.webm?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/e15f2876cd30ddc8cd193c80cc7694f3.mp4?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exclusive Cars, Diverse Tracks, and Personalized Customization</h2>Start with three specialized cars and unlock two more as you progress. Each track offers unique challenges to test your skills. Customize your select vehicles to match your racing style and see the impact on your track performance.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/041206e84ffda85ddd0cb472c2130536.poster.avif?t=1707397779\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/041206e84ffda85ddd0cb472c2130536.webm?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/041206e84ffda85ddd0cb472c2130536.mp4?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
