tunts and Individual Triumphs</h2>Master extreme jumps, twists, and flips in this solo racing adventure. Customize for peak performance, conquer challenging tracks, and elevate your racing prowess. Every race is a chance to defy gravity and make your mark!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/e15f2876cd30ddc8cd193c80cc7694f3.poster.avif?t=1707397779\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/e15f2876cd30ddc8cd193c80cc7694f3.webm?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/e15f2876cd30ddc8cd193c80cc7694f3.mp4?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exclusive Cars, Diverse Tracks, and Personalized Customization</h2>Start with three specialized cars and unlock two more as you progress. Each track offers unique challenges to test your skills. Customize your select vehicles to match your racing style and see the impact on your track performance.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/041206e84ffda85ddd0cb472c2130536.poster.avif?t=1707397779\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/041206e84ffda85ddd0cb472c2130536.webm?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663450/extras/041206e84ffda85ddd0cb472c2130536.mp4?t=1707397779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
